# Force LF line endings for source, configuration, scripts and test data.
# Without this, Windows checkout converts everything to CRLF and byte-exact
# bundle comparisons in test/cli/build.test.ts diverge from the
# Rollup-generated (LF) output.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary types we should never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.svg binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
